Subject: [PATCH] add optional xray_lite client distribution for Passwall

Keep the upstream data plane, JSON builders and socket options for SOCKS,
REDIRECT/TPROXY, VLESS RAW/TLS/REALITY Vision, freedom and blackhole.
Retain upstream SOCKS HTTP fallback and VLESS reverse proxy implementations.
Use build tags to exclude unused config builders and runtime registries.
Split hidden Hysteria, Lua, gRPC credentials, ECH DNS and YAML/TOML
out of the lite client. Reject omitted features explicitly. Default builds
retain the complete upstream features. The existing ARM64 EIP93
standard-library overlay remains independent.

